    "demonstrates": "The v1 deterministic suite measures retrieval and safety boundaries at 10,000 active records. The v2 development split compares two pinned local embedding candidates and one isolated structured-passage follow-up without opening its sealed held-out split. A zero-inference oracle analysis proves that a reranker-only K=32 treatment cannot meet the English gate on the cached candidate pool. A separate treatment-isolated 12-pair GPT-5.6 Sol max pilot measures end-to-end behavior on the frozen synthetic suite.",
